OL,3,GNEWSAFirst 'quiet lane' change set for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first road changes for a county's
OL,7,Fnew "quiet lanes" project are set to be
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FOxfordshire County Council's plans
OL,11,Finvolve a set of partial road closures
OL,12,Fto traffic using gates or bollards,
OL,13,Fcreating routes for cyclists,
OL,14,Fpedestrians and horse riders when there
OL,15,Fis an alternative available.
OL,17,FThe scheme has been met with mixed
OL,18,Freactions, though the majority of
OL,19,Fresponses to a public consultation have
OL,20,Fbeen supportive. A traffic management
OL,21,Fofficer with Thames Valley Police has
OL,22,Fvoiced his objection.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
