OL,3,GNEWSAFirst 'quiet lane' change set for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts proponents at the council say it
OL,7,Fwill make rural roads and key links
OL,8,Fbetween urban areas "more attractive to
OL,9,Fa wider range of road-users".
